        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Hopscotch, Diapers.com\n- People: Rahul Anand, Marc Lore, Vinit Bharara\n- Places: Mumbai, India, Montclair, New Jersey\n- Topics: ecommerce, baby products\n\nFacts:\n- Diapers.com was founded in 2005 by Marc Lore and Vinit Bharara in Montclair, New Jersey.\n- Diapers.com was an online specialty retailer for baby products and one of the largest baby ecommerce sites in the U.S.\n- Hopscotch is an ecommerce company founded in 2011 by Rahul Anand.\n- Rahul Anand previously worked at Diapers.com.\n- Rahul Anand is an alum of Harvard Business School and the University of Michigan.\n- Hopscotch is headquartered in Mumbai, India.",
